factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The reel_script says the Cauvery video shows saree/cloth 'குவித்து வைத்து அலசும்' at night, which matches the article, but the draft's slides_spec and caption omit nothing critical; however the reel_script states the sealing of dye factories as a current action ('சீல் வைக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது') while the article only says such units were sealed in the context of earlier discharge, so the link to the present dyeing is presented as fact without clear source support.
  The slides_spec 'பின்னணி' line says 'இரவில் ஆற்றில் துணி அலசுவது தொடர்கிறது' (night washing is continuing), which is not stated in the article; the article only says it is reported ('கூறப்படுகிறது').
  The slides_spec 'எங்கே?' slide states 'இடம்: காவிரி ஆறு' and the 'என்ன நடந்தது?' slide describes the activity as fact ('அலசுவதாக வீடியோ'), mixing the reported claim with confirmed fact, and the 'பின்னணி' line combines the factory sealing with the night washing as if they were one event (two different facts mixed into one line).
  The caption says the factory owners 'சுத்தம் செய்து வருவதாகக் கூறப்படுகிறது' but the reel_script omits that the sealing was of factories that discharged untreated waste, mixing it with the current washing activity, a fact-mixing issue.
  The reel_script and slides say 'சாயத்துணிகள் அலசப்படுவதாக வீடியோ வெளியாகியுள்ளது' while the article's headline and body describe 'குவித்து வைத்து' (piled up) cloth; 'குவித்து' detail is present in reel_script but the slides_spec 'என்ன நடந்தது?' line omits the video's relation to the piled-up cloth, leaving the description inconsistent.
